        notes="Shelter opens at 3 p.m. with daily intakes; bring one large suitcase per person, medications, and custody papers if applicable; extreme weather protocols expand hours and capacity.",
        notes_es="El refugio abre a las 3 p.m. con admisiones diarias; traiga una maleta grande por persona, medicamentos y documentos de custodia si aplica; los protocolos de clima extremo amplían horarios y capacidad.",
        hours="Open 24/7, 365 days; shelter intake daily from 3:00 p.m.",
